<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables - Saks Holdings Inc.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables - Saks Holdings Inc.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Tuesday that Saks Holdings Inc was not available for after-hours trading for news.</p>
<p>The exchange also said Corimon SACA was also unavailable.</p>
</text>
